# A command that reads a line: what is typed while it runs is passed to it,
# and a resize resizes its terminal. A paste waits 200 ms: DEFECT DF-fm-02.
size 80 24
expect 1
keys !
expect 2
sleep 200
paste read x
expect 3
key enter
expect 4
resize 70 20
keys hello\r
expect 5
keys z
expect 6
keys q
expect 7
keys q
